Based on Sim-U-Kraft by Scott Hather (Satscape).
The 154 legacy .txt blueprints (and their .litematic conversions) and three block textures
are redistributed from Sim-U-Kraft; the original author name is kept in each blueprint's AU= field.
Blueprint credits: assets/neo_sim/buildings/CREDITS.md

.litematic format implementation is independently written with reference to the Litematica
project by masa and contributors.

Sable by RyanHCode is used only through reflection for interoperability;
no Sable code or assets are included.
